@startuml
title EduPattern Studio - Test Session State Diagram

[*] --> NotStarted

NotStarted --> InProgress : start session
InProgress --> AnswerSaved : answer question
AnswerSaved --> InProgress : next question
InProgress --> SnapshotSaved : save state
SnapshotSaved --> InProgress : continue
InProgress --> Restored : restore state
Restored --> InProgress : continue
InProgress --> Completed : all questions answered
Completed --> [*]

@enduml